id=apex_rom
name=APEX ROM Agent Spine
version=v1.0.0
versionCode=1
author=takon
description=APEX ROM agent-spine: system services, ApexControl, NFCForge, PTK TUI, init scripts, SELinux policy, and build.prop overlays for Redmi Note 12 4G (topaz/tapas). Requires KernelSU-Next. Does NOT flash kernel or boot image — kernel is flashed separately via AnyKernel3.
